From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Make regression failures visible to automated builds

The upstream script prints failed cases but exits zero. Keep every case and
return a failing status when setup or any comparison fails.

--- a/src/test/regression/test.pl
+++ b/src/test/regression/test.pl
@@ -26,2 +26,1 @@
-		print "***> cd failed!\n";
-		next;
+		die "***> cd failed for $prog: $!\n";
@@ -74,0 +74,2 @@
+	die "***> $f regression cases failed for $prog\n" if $f;
+	chdir($stdir) or die "***> cd back failed: $!\n";
